n33082.content:
\begin{lemma}[Tempering]\label{tempering_posLog}
  \lean{ErgodicTheory.ae_tendsto_orbit_div_atTop_zero}\leanok
  If \(T\) is measure-preserving and \(g\in L^1(\mu)\), then for \(\mu\)-a.e.\ \(x\),
  \(\tfrac1n\,g(T^n x)\to 0\).
