  For $\hat\mu$-a.e.\ orbit class $q$ there is a \emph{positive} $L$ with
  $\operatorname{HasFlowExponent} q\,L$: the hyperbolicity of the cat map, $(3+\sqrt5)/2 > 1$,
  makes $L = \log((3+\sqrt5)/2) > 0$.
\end{theorem}

n33291.content:
\begin{proof}\leanok
  \uses{thm:susp-catHasFlow}
